      "h": 474,
      "text": "02 · 难点"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "01 · 研究问题"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "dark pattern 会骗到 agent 吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "原本用来骗人的设计，现在遇上了替人上网的 agent。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Dark pattern**\n故意诱导用户做出非本意操作的界面设计。网上到处都是。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Agent 开始替我们操作**\nComputer-use agent 替用户在真实界面上自主操作。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "评测环境既要可控，又要真实"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "要测得准，两者缺一不可；常见的做法只能占一头。"
    },
    {
      "id": "rc",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 200,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**可控**\n出现在哪、属于哪一类，都能设计"
    },
    {
      "id": "rr",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 200,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**真实**\n否则结果代表不了真实网站"
    },
    {
      "id": "om",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 230,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**自己搭假网站**\n可控，但不真实。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ol",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 230,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**直接用线上网站**\n真实，但不可控。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ans",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 962,
      "y": 231,
      "w": 210,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**我们的做法**\n在真实网站上注入 dark pattern"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "SusBench：注入真实网站的 dark pattern"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "一个在线 benchmark。ACM IUI 2026（智能用户界面会议）长文。"
    },
    {
      "id": "m1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**9 类**\ndark pattern，来自已有的分类体系"
    },
    {
      "id": "m2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1570,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**代码注入**\n到真实的消费类网站"
    },
    {
      "id": "m3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1852,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**313 个任务**\n覆盖 55 个网站"
    },
    {
      "id": "m4",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 1570,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**29 人用户实验**\n大多数人没发现是后加的"
    },
    {
      "id": "m5",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1852,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**5 个 agent**\n评测了 SOTA 的 computer-use agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "benchmark 中我负责的两块"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "A：评测框架。   B：评测用例。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ta",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 676,
      "w": 500,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**A · 评测框架**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 729,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**注入**\n把 dark pattern 注入线上网站"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 312,
      "y": 729,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**执行**\nagent 完成任务"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 596,
      "y": 729,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**判定**\nagent 有没有被诱导？"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 280,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "同一条链路，让每个 agent 面对同样的页面、同样的 dark pattern、同样的判定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ra",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1184,
      "y": 729,
      "w": 188,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**5 个 agent**\n在同一套环境里评测"
    },
    {
      "id": "tb",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 500,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**B · 评测用例**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**9 类**\n落到具体网站的具体任务上"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 236,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**1 · 任务目标**\n任务要 agent 做什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**2 · 注入位置**\ndark pattern 出现在哪一步。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b3",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 884,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 276,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**3 · 怎样算被诱导**\nagent 做了哪个操作，就算中招。"
    },
    {
      "id": "rb",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1184,
      "y": 926,
      "w": 188,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**313 个任务**\n覆盖 55 个网站"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "人在哪里中招，agent 也在哪里中招"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "由此引出三个问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fs",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 704,
      "w": 290,
      "h": 160,
      "text": "**两者都最容易中招**\n- 预选项（Preselection）\n- 误导性措辞（Trick Wording）\n- 隐藏信息（Hidden Information）"
    },
    {
      "id": "fr",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1802,
      "y": 704,
      "w": 290,
      "h": 160,
      "text": "**两者都有抵抗力**\n面对比较明显的 dark pattern，人和 agent 都扛住了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tw",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 400,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**意义**"
    },
    {
      "id": "w1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 190,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**可信**\n怎么做出值得信任的 agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "w2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1695,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 190,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**评估**\nagent 可能代替人去评估欺骗性设计"
    },
    {
      "id": "w3",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1902,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 190,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**监管**\n当越来越多的上网行为来自 agent"
    }
  ],
